		(uuid "d7626a97-33e7-4c85-8ee3-2dfb8cc07c0b")
	)
	(text "OUT R: tip -> J8.9, sleeve -> J8.10 (GND)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "55122e01-2fa7-4065-a619-30b2d4f32aee")
	)
	(text "For TRS type B controllers swap tip and ring at the jack -\nit is a wire, not a board change."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9bdeb336-2b2c-4138-9b92-bc9d562e3ea8")
	)
	(text "USB-C: optional panel-mount extension lead into the module's own\nUSB-C port. panel_10hp.svg has no cutout for it - without the lead,\nUSB (power, UF2) is reached at the module itself."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.94 139.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b5e78842-ceb6-46b2-b61e-a624c81f59b0")
	)
	(text "Jacks: 3.5 mm, M8 thread, 10 mm dia, nut, solder lugs - stereo for MIDI (3 poles),\nmono or stereo for audio (ring left open). A metal bushing ties the sleeve to a metal panel:\nfine for OUT/L/R (GND), for MIDI IN use an insulating washer or accept it (the opto still isolates)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 48.26 162.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "cb067090-27b6-4d07-8c5a-07238c4c08ae")
	)
	(text_box "Panel - 10 HP, 50.8 x 128.5 mm, 3U (hardware/Panel/panel_10hp.svg)\n- The four jacks mount to the 1.6 mm panel (M8 nut) and wire to J8 on the front board. Sleeves of MIDI OUT and both\n  audio jacks are GND (J8.6/8/10); the MIDI IN sleeve stays open (C8 = optional 100 nF).\n- Jack row at panel Y 109.6, X 8.15 / 19.65 / 31.15 / 42.65 (MIDI IN, MIDI OUT, L, R) - below the 45 x 80 front board.\n- RUN and BOOT are 6x6 tact switches on the front board now (sheet 3), reached through 4 mm holes in the panel."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 175.26 0)
		(size 154.94 20.32)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
